WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.650
What actually changes when ice melts?

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:09.830
Not the particles themselves. They are exactly the same water particles.

00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:15.440
Heat makes them move faster, until they break free of their places.

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:21.013
Heat more, and they escape as a gas: steam.
